h smith claims is  most definitely platonic the actor told  slash film it's not romantic not in the  slightest we're not compatible  the way smith describes it franklin and  zia are more like brother and sister he  explained she kind of just picks on him  he tries to give it back to her and she  always ends up shutting him down that  just represents the bond that they have  they've worked together for so long  trying to save these dinosaurs after the  release of fallen kingdom pineda  revealed that a scene confirming that  zia was a lesbian had been cut from the  film hopefully jurassic world dominion  will take the time to develop this  aspect of her character  jake johnson put in a scene-stealing  performance as lowry crothers in  jurassic world so the news that he  wouldn't be returning for jurassic world  fallen kingdom was a blow for fans of  the easy-going control room worker i  understand people died it was terrible  but  that first park was legit  colin trevorrow told den of geek that  johnson who starred with aubry plaza and  the director's critically acclaimed  sci-fi rom-com safety not guaranteed  didn't show up in the first jurassic  world sequel because there wasn't a  quote genuine organic way to make it not  seem like he's just in it because he was  a great character in a previous film  now that the dinosaurs are out however  there's an opportunity to bring  characters that weren't dumb enough to  return to isla nublar in the second film  back into the story johnson will reprise  his role in jurassic world dominion and  he isn't the only returning cast member  from the first film french actor omar c  best known for international crossover  hit the untouchables has also signed up  for the threequel the european star  played raptor handler barry sembena in  jurassic world a friend and colleague of  chris pratt's owen grady see posted to  instagram and here we go again  it's safe to say that the jurassic world  dominion cast is stacked however that's  no